{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2021-11-15 20:13:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: WEISSLAW LLP INVESTIGATES CORESITE REALTY CORPORATION', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NOV. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEISSLAW LLP\xa0IS INVESTIGATING POSSIBLE BREACHES OF FIDUCIARY DUTY AND OTHER VIOLATIONS OF LAW BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CORESITE REALTY CORPORATION ("CORESITE" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: COR) IN CONNECTION WITH THE PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF THE COMPANY BY AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION ("AMERICAN TOWER") (NYSE: AMT) VIA A TENDER OFFER.\xa0 UNDER THE TERMS OF THE ACQUISITION AGREEMENT, THE COMPANY\'S SHAREHOLDERS WILL RECEIVE $170.00 PER SHARE IN CASH FOR EACH SHARE OF CORESITE COMMON STOCK THAT THEY HOLD.'}